OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun suspended over 'worrying'
OL,4,Aovertaking issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parkrun event has been suspended for
OL,7,Ftwo weeks following a surge in
OL,8,Fattendance and safety concerns over
OL,9,Frunners overtaking on narrow sections
OL,10,Fof the course.
OL,12,FWeymouth parkrun, held at Lodmoor
OL,13,FCountry Park, has been attracting more
OL,14,Fthan 500 participants each week, with
OL,15,F590 people completing the 5km
OL,16,F(3.1-mile) route on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
