OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1787102844
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4G2G2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun suspended over 'worrying'
OL,4,Aovertaking issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers said they made the decision
OL,7,Fafter a rise in numbers and, "more
OL,8,Fworryingly", an increase in reports of
OL,9,Frunners overtaking in confined areas,
OL,10,Fcausing some participants to be barged
OL,11,Finto or tripped.
OL,13,FEvents scheduled for 22 and 29 August
OL,14,Fhave been cancelled. Organisers expect
OL,15,Fthe parkrun to resume in September once
OL,16,Fnew signage has been installed.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
